{"seq":1,"slug":"merge-eligibility-rule","title":"同收件人/地址/时效合单条件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-consolidation-group-ship/consolidation-model/merge-eligibility-rule","wordCount":2743,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"同收件人-地址-时效合单条件\">同收件人/地址/时效合单条件</h1><p>合单资格判定的第一版实现通常写成一行布尔表达式：地址相同 &amp;&amp; 收件人相同 &amp;&amp; 时效兼容。上线一周后它会被改掉，因为三种误判会同时出现——把同一个人的两个地址判成不同（地址写法不一致），把同一栋楼的两个住户判成同一个（地址不够细），以及把两笔本该合并的单判成合规（合并后超出承诺时效）。这一篇要把这个布尔表达式展开成一套<strong>可配置、可复现、能输出否决理由</strong>的判定规则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>合单资格判定的输入是<strong>一组订单</strong>，输出不是一个布尔值，而是一个<strong>判定记录</strong>：<code>{可合标签, 打分, 否决/限制条件列表, 判定所用规则的版本号}</code>。之所以必须输出规则版本，是因为判定结果要在事后被复现——三个月后一笔单为什么没合，答案必须能从当时的规则与配置算出来。</p>\n<p>判定分三层，层次之间是「必须全部通过」的与关系，但每一层内部是打分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>输出形态</th>\n<th>失败后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>硬否决层</td>\n<td>是否触犯不可协商的约束（危险品、禁运、冷链冲突）</td>\n<td>布尔</td>\n<td>直接排除该组合，不进入打分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等价层</td>\n<td>收件人与地址是否指向同一个收件点</td>\n<td>相似度分数</td>\n<td>低于阈值则视为不同收件人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时序层</td>\n<td>合并后是否仍能满足所有订单的承诺时效</td>\n<td>可行窗口交集</td>\n<td>交集为空则不可合，交集窄则降级为「可合但需等待」</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[候选订单组] --&gt; B[硬否决层: 属性/合规冲突]&#10;    B --&gt;|否决| X[排除组合 记录理由]&#10;    B --&gt;|通过| C[等价层: 收件人识别]&#10;    C --&gt; D[地址归一化与相似度]&#10;    D --&gt;|低于阈值| X&#10;    D --&gt;|通过| E[时序层: 承诺时效交窗口]&#10;    E --&gt;|交集为空| X&#10;    E --&gt;|交集非空| F[打分: 节省额/合并成本/风险]&#10;    F --&gt; G[输出判定记录 含规则版本]\">graph TD\n    A[候选订单组] --&gt; B[硬否决层: 属性/合规冲突]\n    B --&gt;|否决| X[排除组合 记录理由]\n    B --&gt;|通过| C[等价层: 收件人识别]\n    C --&gt; D[地址归一化与相似度]\n    D --&gt;|低于阈值| X\n    D --&gt;|通过| E[时序层: 承诺时效交窗口]\n    E --&gt;|交集为空| X\n    E --&gt;|交集非空| F[打分: 节省额/合并成本/风险]\n    F --&gt; G[输出判定记录 含规则版本]</pre><h2 id=\"地址归一化-把写法差异消掉-把楼层差异留住\">地址归一化：把写法差异消掉，把楼层差异留住</h2><p>地址合单的正确率几乎完全由<strong>归一化</strong>的质量决定，而它面对的是两个方向相反的错误。</p>\n<p><strong>过度归一化</strong>会把不该合的合起来。典型场景：同一栋写字楼里 3007 与 3008 两个不同公司的前台，归一到「XX 大厦」之后变成同一个收件点；一个小区里不同楼栋的「A 座」「B 座」被抹掉。这在跨境场景尤其危险，因为合并之后的包裹投递失败成本极高——退回一次要跨境、要清关、要重新派送。</p>\n<p><strong>归一化不足</strong>会让该合的合不上。拼写变体（<code>Rd</code>/<code>Road</code>/<code>路</code>）、邮编缺失、大小写与全角半角差异、电话号码格式、同一地址的多种语言写法（西语地址的 <code>Calle</code>/<code>Cl.</code>），都会把同一个物理点判成两个。</p>\n<p>工程上的做法是把归一化拆成<strong>保留性归一化</strong>与<strong>可比较型抽象</strong>两步。保留性归一化只做无歧义的规范变换：统一字符宽度、统一大小写、展开常见缩写、按国别规则规范邮编格式、把电话号码规整成 E.164。可比较型抽象再决定<strong>比较到哪一级</strong>——这一点必须按国别与场景配置，因为「精确到门牌」在部分市场是必需（写字楼），在另一些市场根本拿不到（大量地址只写到街道与收件人姓名）。</p>\n<p>一个可靠的收件点标识应当<strong>多信号融合</strong>，而不是只依赖地址字符串：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>地址结构键</strong>：归一化后的 <code>国家 + 省州 + 城市 + 街道 + 门牌/单元</code>，缺失层级用占位而不是省略，避免不同粒度的地址在字符串上意外相等。</li>\n<li><strong>收件人身份键</strong>：手机号 E.164 或邮箱的规范形式。这是最强的信号之一，但受限于买家会为不同订单填不同联系人。</li>\n<li><strong>地理编码</strong>：地址转经纬度后的高精度坐标（精确到建筑级别）。坐标为同一栋楼的两个单元会给出几乎相同的坐标，因此坐标只能作为<strong>加分项</strong>，不能作为唯一判据——这正是把过度归一化挡回来的那一层。</li>\n<li><strong>历史共址证据</strong>：同一账号历史订单里这两个地址是否长期同时出现（家庭成员、公司/家两址）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>判定规则宜表述为：<strong>主键</strong>（地址结构键或收件人身份键）<strong>命中任一即为候选等同，再由辅助信号做否决</strong>。坐标距离超过该市场「同楼半径」阈值、或历史证据显示两者从不同时出现，则否决。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>强度</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n<th>工程处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>收件人手机号一致</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>代收点/驿站共用号码</td>\n<td>与地址结构键联合判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地址结构键完全一致</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>不同单元被省略层级</td>\n<td>要求门牌/单元层级存在</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地理编码接近</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>同楼不同单元</td>\n<td>仅作加分，不作主键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>姓名相似</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>同名不同人</td>\n<td>仅作加分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史共址</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>数据稀疏、冷启动</td>\n<td>缺失时降权而非否决</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"时效窗口-把-会不会超时-变成可计算的约束\">时效窗口：把「会不会超时」变成可计算的约束</h2><p>地址相同只是必要条件。两笔单能不能合，取决于<strong>合并之后的实际发运时刻，是否仍能让每一笔单在各自的承诺时效内送达</strong>。这一步的难点在于：发运时刻本身取决于合并决策。</p>\n<p>给每笔订单 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 定义三组时间：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>承诺时效</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：对买家的承诺送达日（或承诺发货截止日）。这是对外契约，不可协商。</li>\n<li><strong>最早可发时刻</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：该订单的货最早能到达合包节点的时刻。它受卖家备货时长、揽收时长、境内段时效影响。</li>\n<li><strong>运输时长</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>：合并成母包之后，从合包节点到买家所需的跨境段时长（头程 + 清关 + 尾程）。合包方案 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 有它自己的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个候选合并方案 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 可行的充要条件是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_{i \\in S} r_i + \\tau_S \\le \\min_{i \\in S} D_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.355em;vertical-align:-0.7717em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7717em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.455em;vertical-align:-0.7717em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7717em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>左侧是「等最后一笔到齐 + 走完跨境段」的时刻，右侧是该组里最紧的承诺时效。这个式子里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_{i \\in S} r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6079em;vertical-align:-0.1774em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1774em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是关键：<strong>合并的成本之一就是等最慢的那一笔</strong>，而这一等可能把整组拖过某笔订单的 deadline。式子的可行窗口宽度为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_S = \\min_{i \\in S} D_i - \\max_{i \\in S} r_i - \\tau_S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.455em;vertical-align:-0.7717em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7717em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.355em;vertical-align:-0.7717em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7717em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_S \\ge 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 即可行，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>S</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越小风险越高（任何一处延迟都会把整组推过线）。因此判定记录里除了「可合」还应有<strong>余量</strong>，并据此分为三档：余量充足可直接合，余量紧张需标记为高风险合单（第三章第 1 篇会说明它如何触发截单时间冲突处理），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_S &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 直接不可合。</p>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>，这一点使问题不再是「两两能不能合」的简单聚合：把第三笔加进来可能让计费重跨过一个档位从而改变渠道与时长（见 <a href=\"../merge-savings/weight-volume-combine\">合包重量/体积重合并计费</a>），也可能因为多了一个待等订单而降低余量。因此<strong>可行性判定必须在候选方案层面做，而不是两两判定后传递闭包</strong>——后者在多数情况下会给出错误的可行集合，因为它假设了合并的可加性，而时效约束（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span></span>）恰恰不可加。</p>\n<h2 id=\"判定函数的工程形态与可复现性\">判定函数的工程形态与可复现性</h2><p>把上面的规则落成代码时，有三条约束值得在设计阶段就定下来。</p>\n<p><strong>第一，判定必须是无副作用的纯函数。</strong> 输入快照（订单属性、地址归一化结果、规则配置版本、承运时效表版本），输出判定记录。不允许在判定过程中读实时可变状态（如「仓里现在忙不忙」）——这类状态属于<strong>方案优化</strong>阶段，不属于<strong>资格判定</strong>阶段。把两者分开的收益是：资格判定的结果可以缓存、可以重放，而方案优化每轮重算。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，所有阈值与配置必须版本化。</strong> 地址相似度阈值、同楼半径、时效余量分档线、硬否决的属性清单，全部放进带生效时间的配置表。判定记录里存配置版本号，使任何历史判定都可复现。这与售后政策引擎的通行做法一致：把规则变成数据，让判定成为纯函数。</p>\n<p><strong>第三,判定要输出否决理由的可读分类</strong>。<code>ACCEPT</code>、<code>REJECT_ADDRESS_MISMATCH</code>、<code>REJECT_WINDOW_INFEASIBLE</code>、<code>REJECT_COMPLIANCE</code>、<code>ACCEPT_LOW_MARGIN</code>。运营只有拿到分类才能回答「为什么不给我合单」这类客服问题，也才能用分类的分布去发现系统性问题——若 <code>REJECT_ADDRESS_MISMATCH</code> 在某市场突然翻倍，多半是地址归一化规则在那边失效了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与舍阈值-为什么不给全合\">与舍阈值：为什么不给全合</h2><p>一个容易忽略的事实是：<strong>能合不意味着该合</strong>。判定层只回答可行性，是否真的把两笔单合成一个包，还要看合并的净收益（第二章的核心）。当两笔单量都很小、都在同一个境内段批量里、合并只能省下很少的续重费，却要付出合包作业成本与更高的失败风险时，不合并是更优解。</p>\n<p>因此系统的最终形态通常是两级：资格判定给出<strong>可合候选集</strong>与每个候选的余量，收益计算给出<strong>合并净收益</strong>，方案优化在候选集里选一个使总收益最大、同时不违反余量约束的合并方案。这两级之间的接口必须稳定，因为它们是两个变更原因不同的模块——资格规则跟着地址与合规规则变，收益公式跟着运价与计费规则变。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>合单资格判定必须输出判定记录（含标签、打分、理由分类、规则版本），而不是一个布尔值；判定必须能事后复现。</li>\n<li>判定分三层：硬否决层只做排除不参与打分，等价层解决收件人识别，时序层用可行窗口约束合并。</li>\n<li>地址归一化要区分「保留性归一化」与「可比较型抽象」；收件点标识应融合地址结构键、收件人身份键、地理编码与历史共址四类信号，坐标只作加分以挡回过度归一化。</li>\n<li>时效可行性由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_S = \\min_i D_i - \\max_i r_i - \\tau_S \\ge 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 定义，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 体现了「等最慢一笔」的合并成本；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 依赖合并方案本身，因此判定必须在方案层面做而非两两传递。</li>\n<li>判定是纯函数、阈值全部版本化、否决理由分类可读，这三条决定了系统能否被运营与审计使用。</li>\n<li>判定只给可行性，是否值得合由收益决定，见 <a href=\"../merge-savings/freight-savings-calc\">合单运费节省与门槛计算</a>；合并主体能否跨店铺见 <a href=\"cross-seller-merge\">跨店铺订单合发可行性</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 造成的等待与截单时间的冲突见 <a href=\"../merge-conflict/time-window-conflict\">截单时间/备货不同步冲突</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"同收件人/地址/时效合单条件","id":"同收件人-地址-时效合单条件"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"地址归一化：把写法差异消掉，把楼层差异留住","id":"地址归一化-把写法差异消掉-把楼层差异留住"},{"level":2,"text":"时效窗口：把「会不会超时」变成可计算的约束","id":"时效窗口-把-会不会超时-变成可计算的约束"},{"level":2,"text":"判定函数的工程形态与可复现性","id":"判定函数的工程形态与可复现性"},{"level":2,"text":"与舍阈值：为什么不给全合","id":"与舍阈值-为什么不给全合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"跨店铺订单合发可行性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-consolidation-group-ship/consolidation-model/cross-seller-merge"}}